      "mergeID": "69de593d994225cccec139cd",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I joined an instance and seconds later i found a clone of myself in the world, not moving around but in the falling animation. The clone loaded in as my fallback (but kept the blue \"loading in...\" icon) while i saw myself as my quest version avatar. Another person (pc vr) in the instance didnt see this clone though. The instance showed that there are 3 people in it so the clone might have counted aswell. I did not see this in a different world so far, so i am unsure if it's world related.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Seeing a clone of myself in the same instance",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
