      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Additional information: Output logs (394 KB) in [support ticket #707476](https://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/requests/707476) (too much sensitive data to purge/sanitize and post publicly here). Logs start at ~22:42:40, issue logged at 22:51:45.\n\nThis time this happened immediately after I tried joining a Friends+ (friend #1), the instance was emptied while I was joining, I was sent to [\"Must request travel first\" softlock](https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/soft-locked-from-a-launch-url-into-connecting-black-screen-for-two-minutes-could) and then sent to an TryAlternateInstance instance (Friends); I was meant to be the instance owner for this new alternate Friends instance, but somehow my friend #2 had connected to the alt instance before me.\n\nI still had to wait several minutes for my friend to actually load into the instance.\n\nThe player pill was only on the unanimated \"Loading in\" copy and both were initially loaded as error robots.",
