      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm trying to summarize the logs here publicly.\n\n1. Invite generated to join a lonely friend #1 (a sole user of the instance) in Friends+ at 22:42:04\n\n2. Invite accepted to join friend #1's Friends+ at 22:42:08\n\n3. Entering world at 22:42:11\n\n4. Friend #1 left the instance I invited myself to, leaving the Friends+ instance empty.\n\n5. \"Must request travel first.\" at 22:42:40-22:43:41\n\n6. TryAlternateInstance at 22:44:11\n\n7. Entering alternate instance world (Friends) at 22:44:14\n\n8. `Dispatching 1 player join/leave events that arrived during scene load` at 22:44:23\n\n9. `OnPlayerJoinComplete WubTheCaptain` / `OnPlayerJoined WubTheCaptain` @ 22:44:33 - high granular load times seen at this time, `Restored player 1`\n\n10. `[Behaviour] Player ToxicSpel did not receive initial data in time, forcing spawn` @ 22:44:38 - reported `OnPlayerJoined ToxicSpel` at the same time (error robot loading in)\n\n11. ToxicSpel actually loaded in at 22:45:53, `Restored player 2` at 22:45:54, duplicated avatar/user.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
