      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is currently happening to us with up to 5 clones of the same user in the world, and even if that user leaves, the clones remain. We can not get rid of them and it breaks things (apart from performance issues). There doesn't seem to be a specific way of reproducing it, as it happens with multiple users on different platforms and they do nothing special.",
